msgstr "Вибрация геймпада"

#. Key:	PadVibrationDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Tortunabo/Private/UI/Pause/TN_PauseMenuWidget.cpp(2450)
#: Source/Tortunabo/Private/UI/Pause/TN_PauseMenuWidget.cpp(2450)
